Package: cpzeroos-m5-appstore
Version: @V:applaunch@+cpz1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: CPZeroOS <15324879+therezor@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: libstdc++6, libinput10, libxkbcommon0, libssl3t64, libcurl4t64, libfreetype6, sudo
Description: M5Stack's AppStore, repacked from applaunch
 The AppStore binary from the stock launcher package, with only the images,
 fonts and sounds it uses. Not the launcher, and not applaunch-updater,
 which would reinstall the stock launcher. It installs apps through sudo.
 Privacy: it fetches catalogs from GitHub and an Aliyun mirror and asks
 ipinfo.io for the country. CPZeroOS's own Store will replace it.
